  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22RnZf7%22%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"06aebbce\" id=\"06aebbce\"><span data-lake-id=\"uda27488d\" id=\"uda27488d\">线性回归的求解</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"uc86389b2\" id=\"uc86389b2\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"61a3ec66\" id=\"61a3ec66\"><span data-lake-id=\"uff235a49\" id=\"uff235a49\">介绍</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u24c3f2f2\" id=\"u24c3f2f2\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7c08c405\" id=\"u7c08c405\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub2b28037\" id=\"ub2b28037\">本节我们利用前面所学的PyTorch知识, 完成线性回归问题的求解</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0ef7a641\" id=\"u0ef7a641\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc9266b30\" id=\"uc9266b30\"><span data-lake-id=\"u23e8dc9a\" id=\"u23e8dc9a\">技能点:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u66d12de2\" id=\"u66d12de2\"><br></p><ol list=\"u812e0421\"><li fid=\"ucfd9a132\" data-lake-id=\"u9f7d5455\" id=\"u9f7d5455\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3df0cb82\" id=\"u3df0cb82\"> 损失的定义 </span></li></ol><ol list=\"u728b7ede\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"udbaf87eb\" data-lake-id=\"u4978eecb\" id=\"u4978eecb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u105fd1f6\" id=\"u105fd1f6\"> 优化器的定义 </span></li></ol><ol list=\"ud35d0f84\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u84594c46\" data-lake-id=\"ud3ca196e\" id=\"ud3ca196e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u18c18851\" id=\"u18c18851\"> 模型的训练 </span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"uf606ac21\" id=\"uf606ac21\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"06aebbce-1\" id=\"06aebbce-1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0a25a34b\" id=\"u0a25a34b\">线性回归的求解</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u2e573e7c\" id=\"u2e573e7c\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u39750392\" id=\"u39750392\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2831d360\" id=\"u2831d360\">首先, 让我们来模拟一下,线性回归所需的数据集合</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ubef50dc5\" id=\"ubef50dc5\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20numpy%20as%20np%5Cnfrom%20sklearn%20import%20datasets%5Cnimport%20matplotlib.pyplot%20as%20plt%5Cn%5CnX_numpy%2CY_numpy%20%3D%20datasets.make_regression(n_samples%3D100%2Cn_features%3D1%2Cnoise%3D20%2Crandom_state%3D4)%5Cn%5Cnplt.plot(X_numpy%2CY_numpy%2C%5C%22ro%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fc3e3bc2%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uf2e1c93d\" id=\"uf2e1c93d\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua917eac2\" id=\"ua917eac2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u253287b0\" id=\"u253287b0\">如上, 我们初始化了一个数据集合.从图中可以看出,该数据集合大致上是呈线性分布.</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20pip%20install%20scikit-learn%20-i%20https%3A%2F%2Fpypi.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn%2Fsimple%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GtuA6%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u2cb890ef\" id=\"u2cb890ef\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud0723639\" id=\"ud0723639\"><span data-lake-id=\"u217baf9b\" id=\"u217baf9b\">这个案例的目的就是寻找一个良好的函数表达式,该函数表达式能够很好的描述上面数据点的分布,即对上面数据点进行拟合.</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3c9abdef\" id=\"u3c9abdef\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue8fb70f8\" id=\"ue8fb70f8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u310cadf1\" id=\"u310cadf1\">在使用PyTorch求解模型之前,我们需要将上面的数据集转成PyTorch认识的张量</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uee615401\" id=\"uee615401\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%B0%86numpy%E8%BD%AC%E6%88%90pytorch%E7%9A%84Tensor%E5%BC%A0%E9%87%8F%5Cnimport%20torch%5Cnimport%20torch.nn%20as%20nn%5Cn%5CnX%20%3D%20torch.from_numpy(X_numpy.astype(np.float32))%5CnY%20%3D%20torch.from_numpy(Y_numpy.astype(np.float32))%5Cn%5CnY%20%3D%20Y.view(100%2C1)%5Cnprint(X.size())%5Cnprint(Y.size())%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22621c0f02%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u673f1dcc\" id=\"u673f1dcc\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua269193c\" id=\"ua269193c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ude42ab52\" id=\"ude42ab52\">线性函数模型的定义</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ucdf61878\" id=\"ucdf61878\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%5Cnn_samples%2Cn_features%20%3D%20X.size()%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20nn.Linear(n_features%2Cn_features)%5Cnprint(model)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fdf48fc3%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u2ea288a7\" id=\"u2ea288a7\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4be37188\" id=\"u4be37188\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud266e431\" id=\"ud266e431\">定义优化器和损失函数</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7819d73c\" id=\"u7819d73c\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E6%A2%AF%E5%BA%A6%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E5%99%A8%5Cnlearning_rate%20%3D%200.01%5Cnoptimizer%20%3D%20torch.optim.SGD(model.parameters()%2Clr%3Dlearning_rate)%5Cnprint(optimizer)%5Cn%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89loss%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cnloss%20%3D%20nn.MSELoss()%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22a55de875%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u4ba32476\" id=\"u4ba32476\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uaebbe554\" id=\"uaebbe554\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc7d2c18d\" id=\"uc7d2c18d\">最后让我们进行模型的训练,即将数据传入模型中, 然后利用梯度下降算法不断的迭代, 找到最佳的模型.</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue4cd8116\" id=\"ue4cd8116\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22n_iters%20%3D%20100%5Cnfor%20epoch%20in%20range(n_iters)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%20%E6%AD%A3%E5%90%91%E4%BC%A0%E6%92%AD%E9%A2%84%E6%B5%8B%5Cn%20%20%20%20pred%20%3D%20model(X)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cn%20%20%20%20l%20%3D%20loss(Y%2Cpred)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%A2%AF%E5%BA%A6%5Cn%20%20%20%20l.backward()%5Cn%20%20%20%20optimizer.step()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E6%B8%85%E7%A9%BA%E6%A2%AF%E5%BA%A6%5Cn%20%20%20%20optimizer.zero_grad()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E6%89%93%E5%8D%B0%E6%AF%8F%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20epoch%252%20%3D%3D%200%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20w%2Cb%20%3D%20model.parameters()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20print(f%5C%22epoch%3A%7Bepoch%7D%2Cw%3D%7Bw%5B0%5D%5B0%5D.item()%7D%5C%22)%5Cn%5Cnpredicted%20%3D%20model(X).detach().numpy()%5Cn%5Cnplt.plot(X_numpy%2CY_numpy%2C%5C%22ro%5C%22)%5Cnplt.plot(X_numpy%2Cpredicted%2C%5C%22b%5C%22)%5Cnplt.show()%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22b148f78e%22%7D\"></card>",
